{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792369864,"nonce":"A4PwBKrfbNWSbgD5Vge/RNXS+g4=","message":"**Docs and hints popover, and position lookup: 077956f**\n\nOn CodeEditor:\n- `rectAt(offset)` gives a character's place in the window (`{x, y, width, height}`), null when it is out of the view; `offsetAt(x, y)` gives the offset of the character under a window point, -1 over the gutter, below the text or past the end of a line. The two agree: the middle of `rectAt(o)` is `o`.\n- `hover = offset -\u003e Null\u003cCodeHint\u003e` on the editor is asked once the pointer has rested on a character for `hintDelay` seconds (0.45); `CodeHint = {from, to, ?signature, ?language, ?docs, ?className}`. What it gives opens in a popover below the start of the range (above when there is no room), top layer, no backdrop: `signature` is shown first in the editor's own token colours (a declaration, several lines allowed; `language` defaults to the editor's), then `docs` in paragraphs set apart by blank lines, each line wrapped, under `--ui-code-hint-bg` and `--ui-code-hint-width`. When it returns null, the titles of the decorations over the character are the hint (several lines allowed), with the edge in the diagnostic's colour (`ui-code-hint-error`, `-warning`, `-info`).\n- `showHint(hint, pinned = false)` opens one from code, for an answer that arrives late (`hoverOffset` says where the pointer rests now). Not pinned, it closes like a hover's; pinned, it stays until `hideHint()`, Escape, an edit or a scroll.\n- It stays while the pointer is on the range or on the popover, so the popover can be read, and closes 0.2 s after the pointer is on neither; it also closes on a press, on blur, and when the text or view moves.\n- CodeComponents has 19 checks; tools/snapshot/scenes/CodeEditorHint.hx renders the docs popover and a diagnostic's (`HINT=error`).\n\nStill open in this issue: key hooks, semantic tokens, edits from code as one undo step, caret and selection events. No completion list or signature help yet.","files":null}]}